bash
tor --hash-password "dip12@#12"
Example output will look like:

Text
16:ABCD1234EFGH5678...
Then put that in your Tor config:

tor
ControlPort 9051
HashedControlPassword 16:ABCD1234EFGH5678...
SocksPort 9050
Example config file:

tor
ControlPort 9051
HashedControlPassword 16:ABCD1234EFGH5678...
SocksPort 9050
Then in your server/.env file:

env
TOR_CONTROL_HOST=127.0.0.1
TOR_CONTROL_PORT=9051
TOR_CONTROL_PASSWORD=dip12@#12
TOR_CONTROL_USE_COOKIE=0
TOR_SOCKS=127.0.0.1:9050
